P[r_kaamelottb]="The hero is exactly the man from the first reference picture, same face, same blond ponytail, same horned iron Viking helmet, same fur-collared studded leather armor, same round wooden shield on his back, same brown kilt and fur-topped boots, same painted style. A medieval castle hall with a big round wooden table, plain red banners without any writing, and torches. At the table sits $AR, his head resting on one hand. Beside him two dim-witted knights: a lanky one in a bright blue surcoat over chainmail with a vacant stare, and a stout bearded one in a bright red surcoat chewing a chicken leg. The hero explains something with big gestures. A banquet of ham, sausages, bread and cheese covers the table. hand-painted 2000s 2D point-and-click adventure game scene, painterly detailed backgrounds like classic adventure games, bold dark outlines, warm saturated colors, humorous storybook fantasy, characters with realistic adult proportions and ironic expressions, wide composition, no logo, no watermark, no frame, no text, no letters"
P[r_kaamelottc]="The hero is exactly the man from the first reference picture, same face, same blond ponytail, same horned iron Viking helmet, same fur-collared studded leather armor, same round wooden shield on his back, same brown kilt and fur-topped boots, same painted style. A medieval castle hall with a big round wooden table, plain red banners without any writing, and torches. At the table sits $AR, his head resting on one hand. Beside him two dim-witted knights: a lanky one in a bright blue surcoat over chainmail with a vacant stare, and a stout bearded one in a bright red surcoat holding a roasted chicken leg firmly in his right hand by the bone and biting into the meat. The hero explains something with big gestures. A banquet of ham, sausages, bread and cheese covers the table. hand-painted 2000s 2D point-and-click adventure game scene, painterly detailed backgrounds like classic adventure games, bold dark outlines, warm saturated colors, humorous storybook fantasy, characters with realistic adult proportions and ironic expressions, wide composition, no logo, no watermark, no frame, no text, no letters"
P[r_kaamelottd]="The hero is exactly the man from the first reference picture, same face, same blond ponytail, same horned iron Viking helmet, same fur-collared studded leather armor, same round wooden shield on his back, same brown kilt and fur-topped boots, same painted style. A medieval castle hall with a big round wooden table covered with ham, sausages, bread and cheese, plain red banners without writing, torches. Four separate people stand or sit around the table, from left to right: first the hero, gesturing while explaining something; second $AR, sitting with his chin on his hand, wearing no helmet; third a lanky dim-witted knight wearing a plain bright blue surcoat over chainmail with a vacant stare; fourth a stout bearded knight wearing a plain bright red surcoat over chainmail, holding a roasted chicken leg by the bone in his hand and biting the meat. Each person wears only his own clothes. hand-painted 2000s 2D point-and-click adventure game scene, painterly detailed backgrounds like classic adventure games, bold dark outlines, warm saturated colors, humorous storybook fantasy, characters with realistic adult proportions and ironic expressions, wide composition, no logo, no watermark, no frame, no text, no letters"
PE="a lanky medieval knight in his forties with messy shoulder-length greying blond hair and a short scruffy beard, a blue quilted padded gambeson closed with leather tabs and laces, a grey wool hooded cloak fastened with a small brass clasp, brown laced leather bracers, a wide brown leather belt, brown trousers, a sword in a brown leather scabbard at his hip, a blank vacant stare"
